            "review_title": "Review at Toryu Japanese Fusion Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Nomad29264526568\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n1\nUnsatisfying experience\nAug 2023 • Family\nActually, I write these lines with regret and disappointment, even though the restaurant wasn't too crowded that day, when I was having dessert, the staff brought out a whole plate of maki and said he was sorry for missing out. food, so I had to sadly pack it home and then didn't have any need to eat. The space on the online advertisement photo looked clearly chill but when I got there I was quite disappointed, it was small, narrow, in the corner of the building, The room is small and cramped, every time I order a dish I don't feel comfortable at all. Instead of bringing a drink at a time, I bring a bottle of water at a time, a cup of fruit juice at a time, and another cup of fruit juice at a time. ...oh my god, why don't I bring it just once, I just sat for 1 or 2 minutes and then there was a knock on the door....so the conversation was interrupted, the beef was quite fatty, it felt soft because marinated with a lot of fat, not because of the art of making steak...and the price is really not cheap, guys! In short, the price does not match the quality of service, food and space, I will not recommend this place to my friends.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten September 29, 2023",
